{"3408440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WhamPunch 超能打", "steam_appid": 3408440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is an indie game developed by a solo developer. The current Early Access version offers approximately <strong>40 minutes of gameplay, including 10 types of monsters, 3 boss fights, and one theme level: &quot;Ruined City.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the roadmap, the game will be 3~4 hours,featuring no less than six superpowers, as well as three main levels and some subsequent interesting updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAM! Punch enemies to the building and destroy it !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《WhamPunch》 is a first-person superpowered combat game that focuses on high-speed battles, environmental destruction, and uniquely designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1777453536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1777453536 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using your fists—charge up your punches to send enemies flying with shockwaves and air pressure, creating exaggerated knockback effects. Smash them into buildings, causing massive explosions and large-scale environmental destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all enemies and NPCs can be punched into the air, and most buildings in the world can be destroyed—from streetlights and water towers to even skyscrapers and mountains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/3ea914653a234704bdaa1e727880cc32.poster.avif?t=1777453536\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/3ea914653a234704bdaa1e727880cc32.webm?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/3ea914653a234704bdaa1e727880cc32.mp4?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1777453536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1777453536 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain new superpowers and develop your own combat style. Players can unlock various &quot;over-the-top&quot; abilities like &quot;Fists of Fury,&quot; &quot;Rage,&quot; and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/62c15224244078fadd7ef4e78d063fbf.poster.avif?t=1777453536\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/62c15224244078fadd7ef4e78d063fbf.webm?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/62c15224244078fadd7ef4e78d063fbf.mp4?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1777453536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1777453536 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat against other superpowered beings. The current version features 10 monsters with unique skills and 3 boss fights. Some enemies are lightning-fast, others possess brute strength to knock you back, and some use high-tech weaponry. You’ll need to adapt your strategy and use your powers wisely to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/8892836ba52f645d2df134f0893fd8b0.poster.avif?t=1777453536\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/8892836ba52f645d2df134f0893fd8b0.webm?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/8892836ba52f645d2df134f0893fd8b0.mp4?t=1777453536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS &amp; LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1777453536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1777453536 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your abilities to defeat enemies or complete challenges to reach portals at the end of each level. Explore diverse linear environments—from massive cyberpunk neon structures and decaying post-apocalyptic cities to floating eastern islands or satellite cities in the atmosphere. <i>(Note: The current EA version only includes the &quot;Ruined City&quot; level).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/64472f584f530f1fe957b3d67ae57f8a.avif?t=1777453536\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/c97fa5bbd2bb385b889bdad045222a12.avif?t=1777453536\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/fe2bc3663d9badf5b8874ce55f192b12.avif?t=1777453536\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo project aiming to simulate a brand-new first-person superpower combat experience. We value your feedback via Discord or X! Thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/7226b7837163459eafde0a8a0898ed98.avif?t=1777453536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/7226b7837163459eafde0a8a0898ed98.webp?t=1777453536 width=1560 height=2628 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This is an indie g